{"text": "Oyelaran & Finch Tax Services -- PREPARER NOTES (TY2025, MFJ)\nClient #20417     Preparer: M. Oyelaran     Interview 2/26/2026\n\nTAXPAYER   Petrosyan, Nikolai (\"Niko\")   SSN 542177388   DOB 05/09/1979\nSPOUSE     Petrosyan, Anush             SSN 396-41-9690  DOB 12/01/1982\nDEPENDENTS Davit (son, DOB 3/3/2011, SSN 710 34 3802)\n           Lilit (daughter, DOB 8/19/2015, SSN ends 6134)\n           + Niko's mother Gayane Sargsyan, lives w/ them, no SSN -- ITIN applied for,\n             green card pending. Check qualifying relative test (her income = $0).\nAddress    1630 Glenoaks Blvd #207, Glendale, CA 91201-2214\nPhone      818-555-0156 (Niko)  818-555-0184 (Anush, prefers text)\nEmail      npetrosyan.driver@mail.example\nIP PIN (taxpayer): 402918     Prior-yr AGI: $71,266\n\nINCOME\n- Anush W-2, Verdugo Hills Unified School District (classified staff; CSEA member, dues in box 14):\n  wages $48,902.11, fed w/h $3,871.00.\n- Niko Sched C, rideshare. Form 1099-K from RydeLoop Technologies, Inc. (payer EIN\n  84-2917730): gross $63,418.57. RydeLoop annual summary shows fees/commissions\n  $15,220.04 and 31,870 \"online miles.\" Cash tips per Niko's own log: about 2,900.\n- Interest, Foothill Pacific Bank: $38.12.\n\nVEHICLE (100% business use claimed LAST year by prior preparer -- not right)\n2021 Toyota Camry Hybrid, VIN 4T1C31AK5MU558201, plate 8XKR274. Placed in\nservice 06/15/2021. Mileage log (app export): 38,405 total, 31,870 business =\n83%. Std mileage 67 cents? CONFIRM 2025 RATE before computing. Car loan interest\n$1,104 x 83%. TNC permit + airport placard $312. Phone $85/mo x 80%.\n\nHEALTH COVERAGE\nNiko + kids on a marketplace plan via Covered California Jan-Aug (Form 1095-A, policy\nCC-0094417726); APTC $4,216 -> Form 8962, likely repayment. All on Anush's\ndistrict plan from Sept. Niko mentioned out-of-pocket costs for Lilit's insulin pump\n($2,480) -- won't clear the floor, noted only.\n\nOTHER\n- Charity: $1,200 to St. Sarkis Armenian Apostolic Church (letter on file). Also gave\n  $250 to a city council campaign -- told him not deductible.\n- Est. tax payments: NONE made. Expect SE tax + penalty. Set up 2026 vouchers.\n- Balance due est. $3,950 fed. Refund not expected; if state refund, direct\n  deposit to Foothill Pacific, RTN 123436959, acct 000447190233.\n- Our fee $485.00. Niko paid by card over the phone: Visa\n  4248 6362 7945 8223, exp 09/28, CVV 417. DO NOT KEEP THIS IN THE FILE AFTER\n  POSTING -- shred. (MO)\n- Portal invite sent: https://clients.oyelaranfinch.example/u/npetrosyan; temp password\n  Glendale-7731.\n- Form 8879 to both for e-signature once Marcy finishes review. Target 3/20/2026.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "381 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["M. Oyelaran", "Nikolai", "Anush", "Davit", "Lilit", "Gayane Sargsyan", "Niko", "Marcy", "St. Sarkis Armenian Apostolic Church", "Glendale-7731"], "companies": ["Oyelaran & Finch Tax Services", "Verdugo Hills Unified School District", "RydeLoop Technologies, Inc.", "Foothill Pacific Bank", "Covered California", "Foothill Pacific", "oyelaranfinch"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 33092.5, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 29, "text": "Oyelaran & Finch Tax Services", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Oyelaran & Finch Tax Services"}, {"start": 70, "end": 75, "text": "20417", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "20417"}, {"start": 90, "end": 101, "text": "M. Oyelaran", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "M. Oyelaran"}, {"start": 116, "end": 125, "text": "2/26/2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "2/26/2026"}, {"start": 149, "end": 156, 